    {
      "type": "grammar",
      "id": "u26.d01.grammar",
      "title": {
        "en": "Third conditional",
        "ru": "Третий тип условия"
      },
      "rule": {
        "en": "The third conditional talks about an IMPOSSIBLE past — something that did not happen. Use \"If + past perfect, would have + past participle\". It often expresses regret.",
        "ru": "Третий тип условия — о НЕВОЗМОЖНОМ прошлом, о том, чего не было. «If + past perfect, would have + причастие». Часто выражает сожаление."
      },
      "patterns": [
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "If + past perfect, would have",
            "ru": "If + past perfect, would have"
          },
          "formula": "If + had + V3, would have + V3",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "If I had known, I would have come.",
              "ru": "Если бы я знал, я бы пришёл."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "third-conditional"
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "the real situation",
            "ru": "реальная ситуация"
          },
          "formula": "(I didn't know, so I didn't come)",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "If she had studied, she would have passed.",
              "ru": "Если бы она училась, она бы сдала."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "third-conditional"
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "negative",
            "ru": "отрицание"
          },
          "formula": "If … hadn't …, wouldn't have …",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "If we hadn't left late, we wouldn't have missed it.",
              "ru": "Если бы мы не вышли поздно, мы бы не опоздали."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "third-conditional"
        }
      ],
      "pitfalls": [
        {
          "en": "Use the past perfect after \"if\": \"If I had known\", not \"If I would have known\".",
          "ru": "После «if» — past perfect: «If I had known», а не «If I would have known»."
        },
        {
          "en": "The result is \"would have + V3\": \"I would have come\", not \"I would came\".",
          "ru": "Результат — «would have + V3»: «I would have come», а не «I would came»."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "reading",
      "id": "u26.d01.reading",
      "title": {
        "en": "The missed opportunity",
        "ru": "Упущенная возможность"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "u26.d01.reading.b1",
          "en": "Tom often thinks about the job he didn't take. \"If I had accepted it, my life would have been completely different,\" he says. \"I would have moved abroad and learned a new language. But I was scared, so I said no.\"",
          "ru": "Том часто думает о работе, которую не принял. «Если бы я согласился, моя жизнь была бы совсем другой, — говорит он. — Я бы уехал за границу и выучил новый язык. Но я испугался, поэтому отказался».",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u26.d01.reading.b1.mp3",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "u26.d01.reading.b2",
          "en": "\"If someone had told me how much I'd regret it, I would have been braver.\" Still, he learned something. \"If I hadn't made that mistake, I wouldn't have understood how important it is to take chances. So maybe it wasn't all bad.\"",
          "ru": "«Если бы кто-то сказал мне, как сильно я буду жалеть, я был бы смелее». И всё же он кое-чему научился. «Если бы я не совершил той ошибки, я бы не понял, как важно рисковать. Так что, может, не всё так плохо».",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u26.d01.reading.b2.mp3",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "word": "accept",
          "ru": "принимать",
          "ipa": "/əkˈsept/"
        },
        {
          "word": "brave",
          "ru": "смелый",
          "ipa": "/breɪv/"
        }
      ]
    },
